ction. The address at 3327 Topeka Ave. for co-defendant **Sebastian Properties LLC** is only 0.4 miles from the subject property, which is not coincidental — Walter Huerta''s LLC is almost certainly a prior contract or lien holder with a recorded interest, possibly a failed seller-finance transaction or an unpaid contractor lien, and their in-the-neighborhood footprint warrants a separate title pull before we move.\n\nOwnership history reveals a textbook generational deterioration scenario. **Melvin M. Lockhart** acquired the property via General Warranty Deed on **2/13/1995** (Instrument No. 202200264537 — note the 2022 instrument number on a 1995 deed is a re-recording flag, likely a corrective deed or affidavit of heirship filed in 2022 to clean up title). He paid taxes every single year from **2005 through 2022** — 18 consecutive years of compliance — which tells us this wasn''t a negligent owner historically. The **Independence Title** payment in 2022 coincides with what appears to be that re-recording event, suggesting a title transaction attempted or completed that year. Then payments stop entirely in 2023, 2024, and 2025. The four defendants now named alongside Melvin — **Randall Lee Lockhart, Cynthia Lockhart McDonald, and Randi Niccole','\n',char(10)),NULL,'pre_judgment',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-07T12:37:58.401228','2026-07-10T07:55:40.569620','2026-07-10T07:55:40.569620',1,'individual','high','Lot 7 and 8, Block 3/72233, P.J. Allen Addition, an addition in the City of Dallas, Dallas County, Texas, as shown by the General Warranty Deed recorded as Instrument Number 202200264537 of the Deed Records of Dallas County, Texas','{"account_number": "00000701230000000", "market_value": 208650, "land_value": 208650, "improvement_value": 0, "estimated_annual_taxes": 4646.03, "year_built": null, "effective_year_built": null, "actual_age": null, "building_class": "", "construction_type": "", "foundation": "", "roof_type": "", "roof_material": "", "exterior_wall": 