id in 2021**, meaning there was at least one responsible party making sporadic payments as recently as 24 months ago, but that effort has now collapsed. The **absence of a homestead exemption** is critical: this property is not owner-occupied, is likely vacant or occupied by an heir without legal standing, and no family member has asserted a principal residence claim — all of which accelerates our access and reduces redemption friction.\n\n---\n\n## ¶2 — FINANCIAL PICTURE\n\nThe **live tax balance of $15,671.81** against a DC','\n',char(10)),NULL,'pre_judgment',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-10T08:02:48.622654','2026-07-10T08:02:48.622654','2026-07-10T08:02:48.622654',1,'individual','high','Being Lot 11, in Block D/7999 of Sunny Acres Addition, an addition in the City of Dallas, Dallas County, Texas, as shown by the Special Warranty Deed w/Vendors Lien recorded in Volume 73137 Page 1720 of the Deed Records of Dallas County, Texas','{"account_number": "00000783424000000", "market_value": 135870, "land_value": 60000, "improvement_value": 75870, "estimated_annual_taxes": 3025.43, "year_built": 1911, "effective_year_built": 1911, "actual_age": 115, "building_class": "04", "construction_type": "FRAME", "foundation": "SLAB", "roof_type": "", "roof_material": "", "exterior_wall": "", "living_area_sqft": 909, "total_area_sqft": 909, "bedrooms": 2, "bathrooms": "", "stories": "", "depreciation_pct": 60, "desirability": "FAIR", "air_condition": "WINDOW", "heating": "", "garage_sqft": null, "zoning": "SINGLE FAMILY 5K SQFT", "lot_frontage_ft": 50, "lot_depth_ft": 164, "lot_area_sqft": 7930.0, "land_unit_price": 60000.0, "legal_description": "1: SUNNY ACRES 2: LOT 11 GROVEWOOD 3: 4: 5: 7999D000 011 1007999D000 Deed Transfer Date: 1/1/1900", "owners": [{"name": "LANGSTON BERTHA M EST OF", "pct": 100}], "deed_transfer_date": "1/1/1900", "exemptions": "None", "no_homestead": true, "tax_rates": [], "current_tax_balance": 15671.81, "current_levy": 2841.5, "prior_year_due": 11648.24, "