---\n\n## ¶1 — PROPERTY & OWNER SITUATION\n\nThis is a **pure land play, not a structure play.** The improvement at 4514 Frank St is a 708 sq ft wood-frame structure built in 1921 — 105 years old and carrying a 60% depreciation rating per DCAD. At that depreciation threshold on a sub-750 sq ft structure of that vintage, the building has effectively zero contributory market value; any buyer should underwrite this as a teardown or gut-rehab requiring full systems replacement (electrical, plumbing, HVAC, roof, foundation). DCAD''s $93,830 market value is almost certainly land-weighted for this Dallas 75210 zip, which sits in the South Dallas/Bonton corridor where land basis is being actively reassembled by developers. The lot itself — Lot 14, Block D/2434, Magnolia Park Addition — is the asset. No homestead exemption is filed, confirming this is **non-owner-occupied investment property**, which eliminates owner-occupant sentiment risk in negotiations but also signals the owner has no emotional attachment to the asset. The payment history tells a layered and revealing story: **Dallas County District Clerk paid taxes 1979–1990**, indicating the property cycled through county ownership or delinquency resolution decades ago. **DeBello Armias** held and paid 2015–2016. **Stewart Title** paid 2017 and 2021 — consistent with closing/acquisition activity. **Teffera Biniam** acquired via Special Warranty Deed recorded as Instrument No. 20200054226 on **2/25/2020** and paid 2023 only. Critically, **Electra and Associates, LLC** (3346 Galahad Dr., Dallas, TX 75229) paid 2022, 2024, and 2025 — meaning a separate LLC entity has been covering taxes on a property it does not own of record. This strongly suggests Teffera either assigned beneficial interest informally to Electra, entered a joint venture or option arrangement, or Electra is a related-party entity managing the asset. Electra is named as an **In Rem Only** defendant, which confirms it holds a lien, option, or possessory interest the court must extinguish — but carries no personal judgment','\n',char(10)),NULL,'pre_judgment',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-10T10:33:39.830976','2026-07-10T10:33:39.830976','2026-07-10T10:33:39.830976',1,'individual','high','Being Lot 14, Block D/2434 of Magnolia Park Addition, an addition in the City of Dallas, Dallas County, Texas, as shown by the Special Warranty Deed recorded as Instrument Number 20200054226 of the Deed Records of Dallas County, Texas.','{"account_number": "00000216445000000", "market_value": 93830, "land_value": 44750, "improvement_value": 49080, "estimated_annual_taxes": 2089.32, "year_built": 1921, "effective_year_built": 1921, "actual_age": 105, "building_class": "04", "construction_type": "FRAME", "foundation": "POST", "roof_type": "", "roof_material": "", "exterior_wall": "", "living_area_sqft": 708, "total_area_sqft": 708, "bedrooms": 2, "bathrooms": "", "stories": "", "depreciation_pct": 60, "desirability": "FAIR", "air_condition": "NONE", "heating": "", "garage_sqft": null, "zoning": "PLANNED DEVELOPMENT DISTRICT", "lot_frontage_ft": 40, "lot_depth_ft": 123, "lot_area_sqft": 4475.0, "land_unit_price": 10.0, "legal_description": "1: MAGNOLIA PARK 2: BLK D/2434 LT 14 3: 4: INT202000054226 DD02252020 CO-DC 5: 2434 00D 01400 1002434 00D Deed Transfer Date: 2/25/2020", "owners": [{"name": "TEFFERA BINIAM", "pct": 100}], "deed_transfer_date": "2/25/2020", "exemptions": "None", "no_homestead": true, "tax_rates": [], "current_tax_balance": 0.0, "current_levy": 2143.0, "prior_year_due": 0.0, "payment_history": [{"date": "2026-01-31", "amount": 7602.73, "tax_year": "2022, 2024, 2025", "payer": "ELECTRA ASSOCIATES"}, {"date": "2024-01-31", "amount": 2208.5, "tax_year": "2023", "payer": "TEFFERA BINIAM"}, {"date": "2021-03-10", "amount": 3531.92, "tax_year": "2018, 2019, 2020", "payer": "TEFFERA BINIAM"}, {"date": "2018-03-30", "amount": 560.2, "tax_year": "2017, 2021", "payer": "STEWART TITLE COMPANY"}, {"date": "2017-05-25", "amount": 2