5:1**, meaning the existing structure drives all value — and given the age and the owner''s apparent financial distress, physical deterioration is a real underwriting risk that must be stress-tested at door knock. The single defendant, **Donna Kay Lazanas**, holds title and resides at the subject address — this is her **homestead or primary residence**, confirmed by the constable service being successfully executed on-site on **01/18/2024**, meaning she was physically present and reachable. The delinquency record shows only **tax year 2022** in arrears at filing, which is a critically important signal: this is **not a multi-year chronic tax evader** but rather an owner who missed a single annual cycle before suit was filed in December 2023. That compressed timeline — one year delinquent to lawsuit — indicates either Garland ISD''s aggressive collections posture or that prior informal notices went unresolved. The absence of prior related suits confirms no repeat pattern of delinquency. This owner profile — single female, homestead occupant, single-year delinquency, no estate/heir complexity — is consistent with a **temporary hardship event** (job loss, medical, fixed income disruption) rather than abandonment or investor neglect. That makes personal contact both more sensitive and more productive.\n\n---\n\n## ¶','\n',char(10)),NULL,'judgment_entered',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-10T13:02:51.237748','2026-07-10 18:44:08','2026-07-10T13:02:51.237748',1,'individual','high','LOT 18, BLOCK 4, CENTURY PARK ADDITION, AKA 2933 FOREST PARK DRIVE, CITY OF GARLAND, TEXAS AS RECORDED IN INSTRUMENT 201900179354, OF THE DALLAS COUNTY DEED RECORDS','{"account_number": "26086500040180000", "market_value": 300000, "land_value": 75000, "improvement_value": 225000, "estimated_annual_taxes": 4996.84, "year_built": 1975, "effective_year_built": 1975, "actual_age": 51, "building_class": "16", "construction_type": "FRAME", "foundation": "SLAB", "roof_type": "", "roof_material": "", "exter