INSERT INTO cases VALUES(105,'TX-23-02226','162nd District Court','GINSBERG, CARL','2023-12-15','CLOSED','TAX DELINQUENCY','NG''ARGE ADIA SHAW','[{"name": "Ng''Arge Adia Shaw", "address": "3563 La Prada Dr., Mesquite, TX 75150-1038", "serviceStatus": "unserved", "serviceMethod": "PRIVATE PROCESS SERVER", "isInRemOnly": false, "notes": "Citation issued 12/19/2023; listed as unserved"}, {"name": "Joni Bartlett Shaw", "address": "3563 La Prada Dr., Mesquite, TX 75150-1038", "serviceStatus": "unserved", "serviceMethod": "PRIVATE PROCESS SERVER", "isInRemOnly": false, "notes": "Citation issued 12/19/2023; listed as unserved"}]','3563 La Prada Dr., Mesquite, TX 75150-1038',NULL,'38047500110010000','LGBS (Linebarger)','LANE, BRANDON EDWARD',6333.9300000000005042,2019,'[2019, 2020, 2021, 2022]',2,0,0,'[]',0,0,0,'Both defendants listed as unserved; case dismissed before service was confirmed','medium',NULL,'2024-08-22','NON-SUIT/DISMISSAL BY PLAINTIFF / PETITIONER',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'dallas',NULL,'[{"entity": "Dallas County", "taxAmt": 1389.73, "penaltyInterest": 978.61, "total": 2368.34}, {"entity": "Parkland Hospital District", "taxAmt": 1538.03, "penaltyInterest": 1084.35, "total": 2622.38}, {"entity": "Dallas College", "taxAmt": 729.96, "penaltyInterest": 511.8, "total": 1241.76}, {"entity": "Dallas County School Equalization Fund", "taxAmt": 59.75, "penaltyInterest": 41.7, "total": 101.45}]',replace('# ACQUISITION INTELLIGENCE MEMO\n**PC Peak Development | Internal Use Only**\n**Case:** TX-23-02226 | **Property:** 3563 La Prada Dr., Mesquite, TX 75150-1038\n**Prepared By:** Senior Acquisitions Analyst | **Date:** June 2025\n\n---\n\n## ¶1 — PROPERTY & OWNER SITUATION\n\nThe subject property is a 1957-vintage single-family residence in Country Club Estates, Mesquite, sitting on Lot 1, Block 11 of the first installment plat. At 69 years old and carrying a **60% depreciation factor per DCAD**, this structure is functionally approaching the tail end of its economic life for a conventional retail buyer — the improvement is likely contributing only a fraction of the $194,970 market value. Without the exterior wall type data populating cleanly from DCAD, we must assume standard frame construction common to that era and subdivision, which at 1,218 square feet places this squarely in the range of a **land-plus-teardown or heavy-rehab play**, not a cosmetic flip. The critical question for our underwriting is the lot-to-improvement value split: if DCAD is attributing $40,000–$60,000 to the structure and $130,000–$150,000 to the land in a mature Mesquite infill pocket, this is fundamentally a **land play** with a distressed structure on top. Country Club Estates lots in this corridor are attracting builder interest given Mesquite''s continued absorption of DFW workforce housing demand, which reinforces that framing.\n\nOn ownership: the deed of record traces to a **General Warranty Deed recorded as Instrument No. 201600157728**, meaning the current owners — **Ng''Arge Adia Shaw** and **Joni Bartlett Shaw** — acquired title in 2016. Prior payment history reveals two prior custodians: **SANDS COETA REDD** (tax-compliant through 2015) and **DELEON AUGUSTO LOPEZ** (who paid 2024 taxes, which is a notable anomaly requiring immediate clarification — Lopez may be a tenant, an informal contract-for-deed party, or a family member making sporadic payments on the Shaws'' behalf). The Shaws'' delinquency beginning in **tax year 2019** — just three years after acquisition — suggests the financial distress predates the lawsuit by several years and is likely structural, not situational. The active **homestead exemption** confirms owner-occupancy, which is both a risk factor (emotional','\n',char(10)),NULL,'judgment_entered',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-10T13:09:33.793810','2026-07-10T13:09:33.793810','2026-07-10T13:09:33.793810',1,'individual','high','LOT 1, BLOCK 11 OF COUNTRY CLUB ESTATES, FIRST INSTALLMENT AN ADDITION TO THE CITY OF MESQUITE, DA