 no one has been for some time. The improvement-to-land value ratio warrants scrutiny — in Fairway Estates, a 2,779 SF structure of this age with 40% depreciation is likely carrying disproportionate land value given Dallas''s eastside appreciation trends, which means **this functions as a hybrid play**: the land carries the majority of the upside, but a cosmetic-to-moderate renovation of the structure could justify a retail or rental exit well above basis. The deed transfer recorded **January 10, 2014** (instrument 201400006735) brought Shelba May into title, and the current split ownership — **MAY SHELBA EST OF at 50% / COX CRYSTAL at 50%** — reflects an intestate or informal estate transfer where Crystal Cox, almost certainly an heir, holds legal title to her half while the other half remains tangled in the Shelba May estate. The heirs of Shelba May were served only by **Citation by Posting** after the court could not locate them, and an **Attorney Ad Litem was appointed**, confirming that at least one branch of this ownership is legally unlocatable or unresponsive. Crystal Cox, by contrast, was personally served by constable at this very address on **03/12/2024**, which means she either lives at or has access to 3908 Fairlakes — making her the primary point of contact and likely the party most motivated to resolve the title situation.\n\n---\n\n## ¶2 — FINANCIAL PICTURE\n\nThe case was filed **January 24, 2024** with a total due at filing of **$6,011.32**, broken down as **$3,','\n',char(10)),NULL,'judgment_entered',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-10T14:57:15.515842','2026-07-10T14:57:15.515842','2026-07-10T14:57:15.515842',1,'estate','high','LOT 18, BLOCK G/8579, FAIRWAY ESTATES ADDITION, AKA 3908 FAIRLAKES DRIVE, CITY OF DALLAS, TEXAS AS RECORDED IN 201400006735, OF THE DALLAS COUNTY DEED RECORDS','{"account_number": "00000815847690000", "market_value": 552320, "land_value": 150000, "improvement_value": 402320, "estimated_annual_taxes": 13276.53, "year_built": 198