ate situation) suggest actual physical condition is below DCAD''s assessed value, and a realistic ARV after light-to-moderate rehab on a home this age in Rowlett 75088 sits in the **$230,000–$265,000** range based on 2024 comparable sales on Pecan Grove Ln and surrounding streets. The ownership picture is materially complicated: **Veronica Estrada** is the defendant of record at the subject property address, but the named co-defendant **Thalia Maitte LeBlanc, as Independent Executrix of the Estate of Roberto Estrada**, signals that **Roberto Estrada is deceased** and the property is caught in an active or recently opened probate. Veronica Estrada is almost certainly a surviving spouse or heir still occupying the residence — the fact that she was served via Constable at the property address on 01/30/2024 confirms physical presence. The estate executor (LeBlanc) was never successfully served — citation was issued 01/25/2024 and returned unexecuted 02/21/2024 via Constable 5, which is a significant red flag for title complexity. Payment history inference: this property','\n',char(10)),NULL,'judgment_entered',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-10T15:01:24.067892','2026-07-10T15:01:24.067892','2026-07-10T15:01:24.067892',1,'individual','high','Tract 1: Lot 7, Block B, Waterside Estates Phase B Addition, AKA 4210 Pecan Grove Lane, Rowlett, Texas as recorded in Instrument 200503640225 of the Dallas County Deed Records. Tract 2: Business Personal Property of Roberto Estrada located at 333 N Shiloh Road, Suite 105, Garland, TX. Tract 3: Business Personal Property of Roberto Estrada located at 3705 Lakeview Parkway, Suite 400, Rowlett, TX.','',NULL,NULL);
