lf-depreciation with no noted recent renovation or deed transfer is a textbook **land play with a teardown or heavy-rehab overlay**. The absence of a recent deed transfer means Yolanda Baez a/k/a Yolanda M. Lozoya has held this property long enough that it pre-dates modern DCAD transfer logging in this pull — likely **long-term legacy ownership**, possibly inherited or purchased decades ago. Payment history tells a fragmented but revealing story: **BAEZ YOLANDA paid 2020 and 2022** but skipped 2021, triggering the delinquency chain; **YOLANDA LOZOYA paid 2025**, indicating she caught up on current-year obligations but only after the lawsuit was filed and dismissed. The dual-name alias (Baez / Lozoya) is consistent with a **married/divorced name change scenario**, which is common in long-term female homeowners in this zip code demographic. The active **homestead exemption confirms owner-occupancy** — this is her primary residence, which elevates emotional attachment but also confirms she is present and likely reachable via door knock. Distress score of **3/10 (Moderate)** is appropriate: she''s not in freefall, but the 2021 skip, the lawsuit, and the aging structure are compounding signals.\n\n---\n\n## ¶2 — FINANCIAL','\n',char(10)),NULL,'judgment_entered',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-10T15:02:32.233190','2026-07-10T15:02:32.233190','2026-07-10T15:02:32.233190',1,'individual','high','LOT 33, BLOCK B, SATURN SPRINGS ESTATES ADDITION, AKA 917 ASHWOOD DRIVE, CITY OF GARLAND, TEXAS AS RECORDED IN VOLUME 91080, PAGE 1507 OF THE DALLAS COUNTY DEED RECORDS','{"account_number": "26509500020330000", "market_value": 178010, "land_value": 40000, "improvement_value": 138010, "estimated_annual_taxes": null, "year_built": 1956, "effective_year_built": 1956, "actual_age": 70, "building_class": "04", "construction_type": "FRAME", "foundation": "PIER AND BEAM", "roof_type": "", "roof_material": "", "exterior_wall": "", "living_area_sqft": 1242, "total_area_sqft": 1242, "bedrooms": 3