INSERT INTO cases VALUES(118,'TX-24-00091','192nd District Court','GINSBERG, CARL','2024-01-23','CLOSED','TAX DELINQUENCY','VENTURA, NICKY, Jr','[{"name": "NICKY VENTURA, JR.", "address": "22150 N HWY 34, TERRELL, TX 75161", "serviceStatus": "served", "serviceMethod": "attorney", "isInRemOnly": false, "notes": "Citation served 02/22/2024; return of service filed 02/27/2024"}]','3318 BOBBIE LANE, CITY OF GARLAND, TX',NULL,'26668500310170000','Perdue Brandon','REECE, LINDA D.',6633.9700000000005886,2022,'[2022]',1,0,0,'[]',0,0,0,'Order of Sale returned unexecuted 03/19/2025','low',NULL,'2024-10-28','DEFAULT JUDGMENT','2025-02-24',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'dallas',NULL,'[{"entity": "GARLAND INDEPENDENT SCHOOL DISTRICT", "taxAmt": 2621.01, "penaltyInterest": 1279.05, "total": 3900.06}, {"entity": "CITY OF GARLAND", "taxAmt": 1602.09, "penaltyInterest": 781.82, "total": 2383.91}]',replace('# ACQUISITION INTELLIGENCE MEMO\n## PC Peak Development | Texas Tax Foreclosure Division\n\n**Case:** TX-24-00091 | **Property:** 3318 Bobbie Lane, Garland, TX | **Prepared:** 2025\n**Classification:** POST-JUDGMENT / ORDER OF SALE ISSUED | **Priority:** HIGH — IMMEDIATE ACTION REQUIRED\n\n---\n\n## ¶1 — PROPERTY & OWNER SITUATION\n\nThe subject property is a 1,596 sq ft single-family residence constructed in 1964, now carrying a 45% depreciation load that places it firmly in the moderate-to-heavy deferred maintenance category for a 62-year-old structure in Western Heights No. 4 Addition. At a DCAD market value of **$285,930**, the implied improvement value is suppressed by that depreciation figure — meaning the land is doing significant heavy lifting here. Western Heights is an established Garland infill neighborhood where lot values have appreciated materially over the last decade, and this is fundamentally a **hybrid play with land optionality**: the structure has rentable or retail flip value if mechanicals and cosmetics are addressed, but the underlying lot in the City of Garland carries its own exit strategy if the structure is beyond economical repair on inspection. The homestead exemption is active, confirming **Nicky Ventura Jr. is owner-occupied or was recently so** — a critical behavioral signal. Payment history tells a layered story: VENTURA NICK paid in 2008, LERETA LLC (a mortgage tax servicing company) paid in 2019 indicating an active loan at that time, NICKY VENTURA paid directly in 2022, and then **PROPEL FINANCIAL SERVICES** — a Texas-based property tax lender — stepped in and paid the 2024 balance. This sequence reveals an owner who has historically scrambled to save the property, likely leveraged a Propel tax loan to cure the delinquency that triggered this suit, and is now sitting on a **live Propel lien** in addition to the judgment. The defendant''s listed address — **22150 N HWY 34, Terrell, TX 75161** — does not match the Bobbie Lane property address, suggesting Ventura may have vacated or relocated, which materially affects contact strategy and property condition assumptions.\n\n---\n\n## ¶2 — FINANCIAL PICTURE\n\nAt filing on **January 23, 2024**, the total tax delinquency was **$6,633.97**, composed of two taxing entities: Garland ISD carrying **$3,900.06** ($2,621.01 base + $1','\n',char(10)),NULL,'oos_issued',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-10T15:05:11.416394','2026-07-10T15:05:11.416394','2026-07-10T15:05:11.416394',1,'individual','high','LOT 17, BLOCK 31, WESTERN HEIGHTS NO. 4 ADDITION, AKA 3318 BOBBIE LANE, CITY OF GARLAND, TEXAS AS RECORDED IN INSTRUMENT 200600450934 OF THE DALLAS COUNTY DEED RECORDS','{"account_number": "26668500310170000", "market_value": 285930, "land_value": 80000, "improvement_value": 205930, "estimated_annual_taxes": null, "year_built": 1964, "effective_year_built": 1964, "actual_age": 62, "building_class": "13", "construction_type": "FRAME", "foundation": "SLAB", "roof_type": "", "roof_material": "", "exterior_wall": "", "living_area_sqft": 1596, "total_area_sqft": 1596, "bedrooms": 3, "bathroo