018** — he paid 2019 taxes himself. Critically, from 2020 through 2023, taxes were paid by **Dallas County District Clerk**, which is the fingerprint of a court-ordered or litigated payment — possibly a prior delinquency redemption, a probate proceeding, or a court-supervised arrangement. That payment source going silent after 2023 and taxes now running delinquent for 2021–2022 suggests the legal mechanism that was backstopping payments has expired or collapsed. Newsome holds no homestead exemption, confirming this is an ab','\n',char(10)),NULL,'judgment_entered',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-10T15:07:57.507350','2026-07-10T15:07:57.507350','2026-07-10T15:07:57.507350',1,'individual','high','UNIT NO. 211, OF 2220 CANTON LOFTS CONDOMINIUMS, A CONDOMINIUM REGIME IN THE CITY OF DALLAS, DALLAS COUNTY, TEXAS, AS SHOWN BY THE GENERAL WARRANTY DEED RECORDED AS INSTRUMENT NUMBER 201300363037 OF THE CONDOMINIUM RECORDS OF DALLAS COUNTY, TEXAS','{"account_number": "00000173794000000", "market_value": 230000, "land_value": 96000, "improvement_value": 134000, "estimated_annual_taxes": 5121.43, "year_built": 2010, "effective_year_built": 2010, "actual_age": 16, "building_class": "14", "construction_type": "FRAME", "foundation": "SLAB", "roof_type": "", "roof_material": "", "exterior_wall": "", "living_area_sqft": 1175, "total_area_sqft": 1175, "bedrooms": 3, "bathrooms": "", "stories": "", "depreciation_pct": 20, "desirability": "GOOD", "air_condition": "CENTRAL FULL", "heating": "", "garage_sqft": null, "zoning": "PLANNED DEVELOPMENT DISTRICT", "lot_frontage_ft": 50, "lot_depth_ft": 192, "lot_area_sqft": 9600.0, "land_unit_price": 10.0, "legal_description": "1: REAVES SOUTHSIDE 2: BLK A/1751 PT LT 2 3: 4: INT201800177413 DD07022018 CO-DC 5: 1751 00A 00200 1001751 00A Deed Transfer Date: 7/5/2018", "owners": [{"name": "NEWSOME REGINALD JAMES", "pct": 100}], "deed_transfer_date": "7/5/2018", "exemptions": "None", "no_homestead": true, "tax_rates": [], "current_tax_balance": 13510.